abstract: "Sixteen papers and eight applied notes, assembled into a monograph, on the sandpile groups of Hecke-Laplacians over quotients of Bruhat-Tits trees and A~2 buildings, their towers, and the operator algebras that carry them; with verification scripts, data and figures reproducing every numerical claim."
